Glamour Stone","Glamour Stone","Shining Stone","Benevolence","A froglok summoner","Lake Rathetear","Shadowed Men","Rathmana Allin","Southern Desert of Ro"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Sultin","text":"I am Sultin - keeper of the three [Incandescent]s of power and the [Rod] of Insidious Glamour. If you are an Enchanter, perhaps we can deal."},{"npc":"Sultin","text":"I am keeper of the Rod of Insidious Glamour - a device of guile and deceit. The rod will increase the Charisma of whomever holds it. Are you [interested] in obtaining the [rod]?"},{"npc":"Sultin","text":"There is much service to Ro which you must perform. I cannot trust you until you have proven your worth to us."},{"npc":"Sultin","text":"If I am to give you this rod, you must bring me the parts to make another. I will need the Golden Rod from the froglok priest in Guk, as well as a Shining Stone from our mortal enemies, the Shadowed Men. Once you have obtained the Shining Stone, you will need to get it enchanted. Cynthia of the Rathe Mountain Gypsy Clan will enchant the Shining Stone for you - give it to her with 50 golden coins. When the Stone is fully enchanted, bring it and the rod to me and I will give you a Rod of Insidious Glamour."},{"npc":"Cynthia","text":"I have enchanted your Shining Stone. To get it further enchanted, take this stone to Tarn Visilin in HighKeep. Tip him 50 golden coins and he will work his magic."},{"npc":"Tarn Visilin","text":"Your Glamour Stone has been fully enchanted. Take it and the Golden Rod back to the temple of Ro."},{"npc":"Sultin","text":"Well done, adventurer. You have kept your part of the bargain, so I keep mine. Here is your rod."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23T00:00:46.659Z","outOfEra":false}
